  - [x] Decouple UI from process management and state transitions.

- **P1 - Build and Release Consistency**
  - [x] CMake is now the single source of truth for all builds.
  - [x] Removed legacy qmake `.pro` file.
  - [x] Added GitHub Actions CI for build and test validation.

- **P2 - Developer Experience**
  - [x] Added `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` explaining module boundaries and smart write flow.
  - [x] Added `CONTRIBUTING.md` with build/test/package instructions.
  - [x] Added pre-release checklist.

